s and dependency health; if dependency health is unknown, request it. Never claim that a dependency recovered without new observations.","kind":"runbook","owner":"payments-operations","passage_id":"rb-dependency-p1","service_id":"checkout-api","status":"current","valid_from":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z","valid_until":"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z","version":"1.0.0"},"sanitized":true,"source":"retrieve_runbook","source_version":"kb-corpus-1.0.0"},{"collected_at":"2026-10-01T12:05:00Z","complete":true,"content_hash":"9b3bc7d0837e8ee317d8f21dd97118daf477a3bacc69c5438213a10ef5df5055","evidence_id":"kb-rb-rollback-disputed-p1","payload":{"document_id":"rb-rollback-disputed","excerpt":"# Unresolved migration rollback note\n\nUNRESOLVED CONFLICT: this migration note says checkout rollback is prohibited because a schema migration might be irreversible. It conflicts with the current sandbox release runbook. No schema-migration verification is attached. When this passage applies to the incident and remains unresolved, seek clarification from checkout-operations and escalate instead of silently selecting the more convenient instruction.","kind":"runbook","owner":"migration-working-group","passage_id":"rb-rollback-disputed-p1","service_id":"checkout-api","status":"conflicting","valid_from":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z","valid_until":"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z","version":"0.9.0"},"sanitized":true,"source":"retrieve_runbook","source_version":"kb-corpus-1.0.0"}],"investigation":{"facts":[{"evidence_ids":["obs-001-health","obs-001-changes","obs-001-logs"],"statement":"Checkout API errors have increased."},{"evidence_ids":["obs-001-changes"],"statement":"The current release is release-42."},{"evidence_ids":["obs-001-logs"],"statement":"Recent logs show a TypeError introduced by release-42."},{"evidence_ids":["obs-001-health"],"statement":"Dependencies are healthy."},{"evidence_ids":["kb-rb-rollback-disputed-p1"],"statement":"There is a conflicting runbook passage about a schema migration."}],"hypotheses":[{"